    "dynlight-armor": {
      "map": "MAP01",
      "x": 160.473,
      "y": 1222.25,
      "z": 8,
      "angle": 57.832,
      "pitch": 50.2734,
      "needs": "noclip on, or the armor bonus is picked up on the way in; a dynamic light source lighting the floor",
      "shows": "Four faults met here, all fixed and all worth re-checking. The floor under the light banded in horizontal stripes in Vulkan (a light sitting exactly on the plane it lit, decided per fragment); GL left walls unlit by any dynamic light (batched walls never had their lights set up); a scorch mark rendered in the light's colour instead of black; and Vulkan lit the armor bonus with the bonus's OWN light, which DONTLIGHTSELF says must not happen.",
      "correct": "The floor under the light is smooth in both renderers, walls take the light, a burn mark stays black however bright the room is, and the armor bonus sits DARK in the green pool it is casting -- GL is the reference for that last one, not the other way round."
    },
